{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37380","headline":"和陶渊明贫士诗七首 三 · 唐彦谦","name":"和陶渊明贫士诗七首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松风四山来，清宵响瑶琴。\n听之不能寐，中有怨叹音。\n旦起绕其树，磈砢不计寻。\n清阴可敷席，有酒谁与斟。\n由来大度士，不受流俗侵。\n浩歌相倡答，慰此霜雪心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37380.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37380","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}